Turn Android sparse image(s) into a raw image

Usage: android-doctor unsparse [OPTIONS] --output <OUTPUT> <INPUTS>...

Arguments:
  <INPUTS>...  Sparse file(s); several files that describe the same image are applied in the order given

Options:
      --no-color         Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  
      --force            Replace an existing output file instead of refusing
  -h, --help             Print help
